(P/'index.html').write_text(head('Avatar Studio 2.0 and final game-feel deltas')+'<main><h1>More personality.<br>More feel. Still Playgrid.</h1><p>An incremental design package for Issue #61. Existing premium game directions remain approved. Production code, homepage and servers are unchanged.</p><nav><a href="avatar-studio/index.html">Open Avatar Studio 2.0</a><a href="characters.html">32 additions + home foundations</a><a href="style-delta.html">Before/after refinement</a><a href="contexts.html">Lobby-size identity contexts</a><a href="CLAUDE-HANDOFF.md">Claude handoff</a><a href="VALIDATION.md">Tests and limits</a><a href="playgrid-61-design.zip">Download ZIP</a></nav><div class="shots"><article class="shot"><h2>Avatar Studio · 1440px</h2><a href="screenshots/studio-desktop.png"><img src="screenshots/studio-desktop.png" alt="Avatar Studio desktop actual browser capture"></a></article><article class="shot"><h2>Phone / tablet references</h2><div class="pair"><a href="screenshots/studio-mobile.png" style="width:35%"><img src="screenshots/studio-mobile.png" style="width:100%" alt="Avatar Studio at 390px"></a><a href="screenshots/studio-tablet.png" style="width:62%"><img src="screenshots/studio-tablet.png" style="width:100%" alt="Avatar Studio tablet actual browser capture"></a></div></article></div><h2 style="margin-top:30px">Six missing interactions. No repeated game pack.</h2><div class="all-links">'+''.join(f'<a href="game-feel/index.html?game={id}">{name}<small>Local component · <span>1440 / 390 / 360px captures</span></small></a>' for id,name in games)+'</div><nav><a href="GAME-FEEL-DELTAS.md">20-game finishing matrix</a><a href="feel-board.html">Screenshot board</a><a href="SCREENSHOT-INDEX.md">All screenshot/state links</a><a href="ASSET-MANIFEST.json">Source-of-truth asset manifest</a><a href="LICENSING-ORIGINALITY.md">Originality and reuse</a></nav><p class="note">Remaining difference for review: SVGs preserve the home-family cues but do not exactly reproduce its painted texture. Claude implements production only after review. Current Go Fish contract is ranks 2–14, Ace=14, correcting the earlier #58 handoff.</p></main><footer class="page">Design-only. No merge/deploy. No paid image-generation API. No removed-game directions.</footer></body></html>')
